Fix command injection in run_report (CWE-78)

The daily and weekly kinds interpolated the report name from the request into
a shell command and ran it with backticks, so a name containing shell
metacharacters ran arbitrary commands as the application user. run_report
now looks the name up in a fixed table of recorded summaries and returns
the match: there is no command string and no shell, so no request input
reaches a command interpreter.
